nectX-4 CX456A Dual Port 100GbE QSFP28 PCIe Network Adapter is a high-performance enterprise-class network interface card (NIC) designed for data centers, cloud computing, virtualization, HPC, and AI workloads. Featuring dual QSFP28 ports with up to 100GbE per port, this adapter delivers ultra-low latency, high throughput, and advanced hardware offloading technologies for demanding networking environments. It utilizes a PCI Express 3.0 x16 interface to maximize bandwidth and supports RDMA, RoCE, and virtualization acceleration for modern server deployments.</p><p><br></p><p>Whether you're upgrading enterprise servers, storage networks, or high-speed computing clusters, the Mellanox ConnectX-4 CX456A ensures reliable connectivity, efficient CPU utilization, and outstanding network performance.</p><p><br></p><h3>Key Features</h3><p><br></p><ul><li>Dual QSFP28 ports supporting up to 100Gb Ethernet</li><li>PCI Express 3.0 x16 host interface</li><li>Ultra-low latency and high packet processing performance</li><li>Supports 10GbE, 25GbE, 40GbE, 50GbE, and 100GbE Ethernet speeds</li><li>RDMA over Converged Ethernet (RoCE)</li><li>SR-IOV virtualization support</li><li>Hardware offload for TCP/IP, VXLAN, NVGRE, and Geneve</li><li>Optimized for cloud computing and virtualization</li><li>Low-profile form factor for enterprise servers</li><li>Supports Windows, Linux, VMware ESXi, and major enterprise operating systems</li></ul>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"Mellanox CX4121A-ACAT CX4 10G/25G SFP28 Ethernet Network Card","href":"/mellanox-cx4121a-acat-cx4-10g25g-sfp28-ethernet-network-card","now":"18,000৳","old":"20,000৳","single":""},{"name":"Silicom 4x 10GE Quad Port PCI Express 3.0 SFP+ Network Adapter","href":"/%20silicom-4x-10ge-quad-port-pci-express-30-sfp-network-adapter","now":"18,000৳","old":"20,000৳","single":""},{"name":"Intel OT-ST7218